*  G27 [G] ARB drawn out by a following literal, WITH conditional capture
*  subject: 'MOUNTAIN'
*  pattern: 'O' ARB . OUTPUT 'A'
*  SPITBOL manual Ch.6 p.64 -- the manual's OWN canonical ARB example, verbatim.
*  ARB must expand from null until the following 'A' matches, and the captured
*  span is what ARB finally settled on: 'UNT' (between the 'O' of MOUNTAIN and
*  the 'A' of ...TAIN).  Oracle prints UNT.
*  ⛔ WRONG-ANSWER witness, NOT a crash witness: a defective build prints a
*  SHORT capture (observed 'NT' at HEAD 2026-08-12, i.e. the capture starts one
*  char late) and still EXITS 0.  Every crash/rc-based gate is blind to it --
*  this probe exists because RULES.md's "exit 0 is NOT exoneration" class had no
*  member on any board.  First recorded RBP-EARN s39; minted BOARD 2026-08-12.

        'MOUNTAIN' 'O' ARB . OUTPUT 'A'
END
